# The keyboard: arrow keys move a board cursor (a ring around the card) among the existing boards; Enter focuses the cursor's board;
# + / - zoom around it; Esc steps back (selection, then framing); U undoes a move; Enter with nothing selected submits.
# Misc - Time Line Battle (three timelines, White to move on all). Layout (1400x800): Versus (150,250); row 7 (905,524 after scrolling the list to its end); Play (808,712).
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
move 905 400
wheel -4             # the list scrolls to its end (seven rows fit)
wait 10
click 905 524        # Misc - Time Line Battle (row 7)
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
key RIGHT            # the cursor appears on the first board that needs a move
wait 20
capture camera-keys-cursor-start
key DOWN             # timeline 0 is the lowest timeline: no board below, the cursor stays
wait 20
key UP               # timeline 1
wait 20
camexpect state Overview
capture camera-keys-cursor-up
key ENTER            # focus the cursor's board
wait 40
camexpect state Focus
camexpect visible 1 0
capture camera-keys-enter-focus
key PLUS             # one step in around the cursor's board
wait 20
camexpect state Free
zoom?
capture camera-keys-zoom-in
key MINUS
wait 20
key MINUS
wait 20
zoom?
key HOME
wait 40
key UP               # (the cursor is on timeline 1) timeline 2
wait 20
key ENTER
wait 40
camexpect visible 2 0
clicksq 2 0 c3       # pick up a pawn on timeline 2 ...
wait 40
key ESCAPE           # ... Esc puts it down (and the nav buttons stay)
wait 20
capture camera-keys-esc-deselect
clicksq 2 0 c3
wait 30
clicksq 2 0 c4
wait 40
key U                # undo the move
wait 40
capture camera-keys-undo
key HOME             # (every board is in view again: below zoom 0.8 a click on a square brings its board up first)
wait 40
clicksq 2 0 c3
wait 30
clicksq 2 0 c4
wait 30
key HOME
wait 40
clicksq 1 0 c2
wait 30
clicksq 1 0 c3
wait 30
key HOME
wait 40
clicksq 0 0 c1
wait 30
clicksq 0 0 c2
wait 30
capture camera-keys-three-moves
key ENTER            # nothing is selected: Enter submits the turn
wait 90
capture camera-keys-enter-submit
